                "textId": "Performance_1999990031_1583461868_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "咩呼呼……咩呼呼……{A叹气}\n为什么，去街市卖这个，\n和络米电视送的盒子一样的帽子……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990031_1583461868_content",
                "value": "咩呼呼……咩呼呼……{A叹气}\n为什么，去街市卖这个，\n和络米电视送的盒子一样的帽子……",
                "duration": null,
